OL,3,GNEWSA'My son might not have survived
OL,4,Awithout Daisy Hill maternity service'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother-of-two who suffered a severe
OL,7,Fplacental abruption during her last
OL,8,Fpregnancy has said her baby "might not
OL,9,Fhave survived" had there been a delay
OL,10,Fin getting to hospital.
OL,12,FKara Finnegan, who had an emergency
OL,13,FCaesarean section in May last year, has
OL,14,Fcriticised the planned suspension of
OL,15,Fmaternity services at her local
OL,16,Fhospital.
OL,18,FIt has been reported that no babies
OL,19,Fwill be delivered at Daisy Hill
OL,20,FHospital in Newry if the temporary
OL,21,Fsuspension goes ahead.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
