OL,3,GNEWSA'My son might not have survived
OL,4,Awithout Daisy Hill maternity service'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Southern Trust has not been able to
OL,7,Frecruit consultant obstetricians to
OL,8,Ffill vacancies and it is preparing to
OL,9,Ftemporarily move inpatient maternity
OL,10,Fservices to Craigavon Area Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
